                                     ent vendors                                            \u001b[39;96H  --no-docs                            Don't install files that are marked as documentation (w\u001b[40;96H                                       hich includes man pages and texinfo documents)         \u001b[41;96H  -x package,..., --exclude=package,.  excl"]
